{"parse": {"title": "RF-1", "pageid": 89555, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E7%87%83%E7%82%B9%C2%B7%E7%84%B0%E5%85%89%E4%BA%A4%E6%B1%87%E5%A4%84\" title=\"可燃点·焰光交汇处\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RF-1</span><a href=\"/wiki/RF-2\" title=\"RF-2\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">1</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.87.83.E7.81.AB.E5.A4.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"燃火处\">燃火处</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 燃火处</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Ignition</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>黑暗像一袭柔软的床褥，它将我拖入它之中，将我包裹，向我迫近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>暗处唯有持续的、有节奏的响动陪伴我，像是鼓点，又如同红土地上的欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>于是我尝试寻找那阵隐约的声响。它搏动着，如此熟悉与亲切，令我的火焰随之摇曳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>而后，远处的光亮扑入视野。我重新遇见了她。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun1\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>在追逐那光亮的途中，我能瞧见她正经历的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>她还尚是一粒火星儿，光芒微弱，却满心好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>一天，又一天。以周围的事物为燃料，所见，所触碰，所听闻的一切都使她燃烧得更旺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你还好吗？你能听见我吗？我们还能再聊起上次未讲完的话儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>没有回音……<br />我仍然呼唤着——向我最最亲密的旧朋友。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……咦？好像有谁叫我？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿放下摆弄照片和剪报的双手，抬起头在房间里四处张望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理所当然，她一无所获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>好吧……一定是我又听岔了，我总是这样，感觉自己听到了什么，但实际上又没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重新将精力集中于这些费了极大工夫找来的收藏之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>再瞧瞧这张……唔，和其他地方记载的乌卢鲁运动会项目不太一样，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们占据了她大部分的闲暇时光，甚至还包括一些本应用于完成家庭作业的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——例如此刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-621120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-621120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-621120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你在吗，小饼干？我能开门进来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>什……我在，我在的！马上就——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>原来没听错……糟糕。妈咪，我现在就来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点手忙脚乱地将桌面的物件塞进抽屉，再摊开作业本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小女孩儿三两步跑到门前，转动把手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>什——什么事，妈咪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>你今天没有下楼拿热牛奶，我就想，我的小饼干应该是正忙着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲将牛奶放到桌边，同时稳稳当当落下的还有一本漂亮的册子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>正好有东西要给你，我就一块带过来了，在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>天哪！这是——是我之前收集的照片和笔记！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我还以为琼斯女士要等到期末周结束才会把它还给我呢，我的宝贝……呜，太好了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>她知道你很宝贝这些，特地用塑胶袋装好放在抽屉的最上层，你瞧，封面上的涂鸦一点儿都没被磨掉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>琼斯小姐是位负责的老师，她也和我说了你的近况……你不该在课堂上走神的，小饼干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>抱歉……我，我不是故意的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我只是——我只是想起照片里的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愧疚的孩子低下头，握成拳的手蹭过眼睑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>没关系，我们慢慢说说。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的手掌绕过小女孩儿的肩膀，将她搂进怀里，头碰着头在床沿坐下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>那时候……琼斯女士正在和我们说起课外运动训练，询问我们最喜欢的运动项目是什么……我想起了乌卢鲁运动会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>然后我抽出册子，打算找些项目出来回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我可以说飞跃树梢，水怪障碍赛……它们都很有趣，但琼斯女士却说，我们只能选择一个“最”喜欢的项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>这对你来说不是个难题，孩子。你最喜欢的运动，你总是把它挂在嘴边……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>是的！是的，妈咪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>那是和传说中的石怪有关的——马林吉的收获！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用力点了两下头，辫子梢像两簇小火苗般在身后跃动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但愉快的火焰只扑闪了一小会，就重又垂下头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我的脑子里挤满了玩马林吉的画面，它们……就像真的一样，像是……我在梦里看到的那些一样……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>运动场的红土踩起来坚实、柔韧，我在空气里闻得见木头燃烧的味道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>人群吵嚷着围住被点燃的火堆，火烧得又旺盛，又美丽，就像一只活泼的动物……我伸手想要摸摸它的皮毛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……然后琼斯女士就握住了我的手。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点从回忆中睁开眼睛，她满怀歉意，声音细微，就像是一只呜咽的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不过，我确实不应该在她的课堂上开小差……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>可是这些事……他们说我都是在做白日梦，说……我只是因为太喜欢乌卢鲁运动会，而变成呆瓜了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>你是一个好孩子，我的小饼干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲轻声叹息，在怀抱中加上了细微的摇动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>你的喜好与你的爱从不是错。无论你喜欢的是绿皮鳄鱼，还是一场消失在历史中的运动会，那都是你宝贵的爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>别因为任何人的指责动摇它们，更别觉得自己糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>你所收集的一切材料都是乌卢鲁运动会的证明，它曾经那样盛大，未来的事情谁也说不定——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲捧起孩子柔软而圆润的脸，抹去泪花儿，又亲热地将其亲吻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>说不定呢，说不定未来的某天，你所爱的乌卢鲁运动会就会回来呢？就像是它忽然消失时一样——忽如其来地再次出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是……真的吗？妈咪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那不是一个谎言，未来的事情谁也不清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更何况，你也很难对这样一个孩子说出残酷的拒绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>当然了，我们总要对生活心怀期待的，小饼干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>但……在那之前，你必须答应我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>语气停顿，话题转折，母亲轻松地一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>上课的时候，还是专注于课堂，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>当然了，妈咪！我以后会注意的——！用一整周的仙女面包发誓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本就为此羞耻的孩子搓着脸蛋，认真地发誓自证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着，她像是想到了什么，又一次抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>啊……对了，妈咪！我想参加课外的运动训练！就是琼斯女士说到的那个，我可以去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>琼斯女士也和我谈到了这个。我很乐意让你去，适当的运动对你的成长有好处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>但……学校并没有提供“马林吉的收获”项目，小饼干。他们必须考虑到神秘学家和人类的身体差异，选取一些对大家来说都更安全的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>是的……我知道这一点。不过没关系的，妈咪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点从母亲的怀抱中挣脱出来，站直了身体，她挥舞两下手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我已经想好了，我要去参加拳击训练班！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回想着伸手捕捉火星的动作，握紧拳头，再摊开手掌——复又握紧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汗水淌过指缝，将掌心浸得滚烫。上升的体温绝不是错觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>没问题，宝贝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的手掌轻柔地抚过小女孩儿的头顶，将几根胡乱翘起的发丝哄得弯下腰去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她以落在额头的亲吻鼓励着怀里这团温热的火苗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>这个周末我们一块儿去挑拳击手套，怎么样？让你爸爸开车，还可以顺带看看护具……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-621101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点母亲：</div><div>还有，从今天起，可不能把盘子里的蔬菜剩下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>噢……我还以为运动员们都能尽情享受一天三顿焦糖巧克力配肉派……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果一定得这样才能做个好运动员，我可以每天吃蔬菜沙拉，就像只努力啃草皮的袋鼠！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小袋鼠充满活力地蹦起来，站在卧室地板上认真宣告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我一定——一定会是优秀的拳击手！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RF-1"}}